**Option B consumer (2026-08-01)** — `phase-6:gate` calls `phase-5:runtime-proof` + `phase-5:guard` + residual apps-cert (`post-test` + `floors`), not nested `phase-5:gate` and not full `phase-3:apps-cert`. Historical 0–5 recursive closure remains `phase-5:gate` / `test:full`. Standalone leaf certification remains `phase-3:apps-cert`.
