# Phase 5 — runtime-proof boundary

## Command ownership

| Command | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `phase-5:guard` | Static contracts — docs/schema/prisma/SQL presence, anti-hollow, doc hardening, `phase-5.contract.spec.ts` |
| `phase-5:runtime-proof` | Runtime/data/security — `db:test-reset`, `phase-4:guard` (not `:gate`), targeted perf specs |
| `phase-5:gate` | Historical full closure — build + test + nested `phase-4:gate` + `phase-5:guard` (**unchanged**; also `test:full`) |
| `phase-6:gate` | Option B — build + test + runtime-proof + phase-5:guard + residual apps-cert (`post-test` + `floors`) + phase-6:guard |

## `phase-5:runtime-proof` graph

```text
phase-5:runtime-proof
 ├─ DATABASE_URL required (fail closed)
 ├─ db:test-reset
 ├─ phase-4:guard          ← RLS + tenant-security + kernel/events floors
 ├─ atomic-write-perf      P5_PERF_GATE_MS=850
 ├─ outbox-throughput      MIN_THROUGHPUT=100
 └─ noisy-neighbor         BASELINE_RATIO_MAX=1.25
```

Report: `reports/phase-5-runtime-proof-YYYY-MM-DD.json`

**Forbidden in this runner:** `phase-4:gate`, `phase-3:gate`, `phase-5:gate`, full monorepo `pnpm test`.

