## Anti-hollow

| Claim | Truth |
| --- | --- |
| `phase-5:runtime-proof` PASS | Runtime slice only — not full `phase-5:gate` |
| `phase-5:guard` PASS | Static/contracts only — not RLS/perf |
| `phase-6:gate` PASS | Phase 6 + Phase 5 runtime/static + **residual** apps-cert — **not** full `phase-3:apps-cert` / api·web leaf-gate composites; **not** historical 0–5 nest |
